			"content:wysiwyg_basic:8:43": {
				"icon": "outdent",
				"name": "WYSIWYG",
				"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
				"html": "<ul>\n\t<li>Friday, August 23 - Quarter&nbsp;Page AD Run (<a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/f46c4760-586b-4feb-afd9-bc7ea6cb5d87_RTD+8.23.24+AD+Clip.pdf\">View AD</a>)<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>Sunday, September 1 - Half Page AD Run (<a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/9ed6dd58-31e4-4495-8393-944853e9c8d8_RTD+9.1.24+AD+Clip.pdf\">View AD</a>)<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>Thursday, September 12 &amp; Sunday, September 15 - Half Page AD Run (<a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/599b6620-e11b-4fbc-acee-ae2960db1c8d_RTD+9.15.24+AD+Clip.pdf\">View AD</a>)<ul>\n\t\t<li>Half Page AD included in spadea at the annual Richmond Times-Dispatch THE BEST&nbsp;awards show, with 800 copies printed and distributed to attendees.</li>\n\t\t<li>Half Page AD ran in Special Edition on&nbsp;Sunday, September 15.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>",
				"description": "Text with HTML references.",
				"draggable": true,
				"content": "<ul>\n\t<li>Friday, August 23 - Quarter&nbsp;Page AD Run (<a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/f46c4760-586b-4feb-afd9-bc7ea6cb5d87_RTD+8.23.24+AD+Clip.pdf\">View AD</a>)<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>Sunday, September 1 - Half Page AD Run (<a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/9ed6dd58-31e4-4495-8393-944853e9c8d8_RTD+9.1.24+AD+Clip.pdf\">View AD</a>)<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>Thursday, September 12 &amp; Sunday, September 15 - Half Page AD Run (<a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/599b6620-e11b-4fbc-acee-ae2960db1c8d_RTD+9.15.24+AD+Clip.pdf\">View AD</a>)<ul>\n\t\t<li>Half Page AD included in spadea at the annual Richmond Times-Dispatch THE BEST&nbsp;awards show, with 800 copies printed and distributed to attendees.</li>\n\t\t<li>Half Page AD ran in Special Edition on&nbsp;Sunday, September 15.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>",
