			"content:wysiwyg_basic:16:40": {
				"icon": "outdent",
				"name": "WYSIWYG",
				"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
				"html": "<ul>\n\t<li><strong>ONSITE:</strong> (3) 10 x 3 ft banners displayed at the race (see photos below)\n<ul>\n\t\t<li>(2) on the finisher barricades</li>\n\t\t<li>(1) on the pop-up tent by the step and repeat<br>\n\t\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><strong>YEAR-ROUND: Physical Footprint</strong><ul>\n\t\t<li>Race t-shirts worn and seen around town (see photo below or post of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=905066014989822&amp;set=gm.1018802169991841&amp;idorvanity=939360217936037\" target=\"\">t-shirt on social media</a>)</li>\n\t\t<li>(50) Yard signs displayed around Greater Richmond</li>\n\t\t<li>All (3) banners will be displayed at The Salvation Army Boys &amp; Girls Club of Richmond (3701 R Street)<ul>\n\t\t\t<li>(2) will be hung on fence enclosing the outdoor play are</li>\n\t\t\t<li>(1) will be hung under the score board in the gym<br>\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><strong>YEAR-ROUND: Digital Footprint (<span style=\"color:#22b573;\"><em>sponsor company name&nbsp;tagged, as available, in all social media posts</em></span>)</strong><ul>\n\t\t<li>Event recap and photos on our <a href=\"https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/centralvirginia/past-events#Run-for-Hope-Sept-14-2024\" target=\"\">Past Events webpage</a></li>\n\t\t<li>Social media posts and reels on Facebook</li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.909422491220841&amp;type=3\" target=\"\">Facebook Event Album</a>&nbsp;and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/reel/8118624761518098\" target=\"\">Pre-Event Reel</a> (already 2.5K plays between all platforms)</li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/salarmyrva_rva-rva-peoplepowered-activity-7242167740059332608-bTz8?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop\" target=\"\">LinkedIn Event Album</a></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>",
				"description": "Text with HTML references.",
				"draggable": true,
				"content": "<ul>\n\t<li><strong>ONSITE:</strong> (3) 10 x 3 ft banners displayed at the race (see photos below)\n<ul>\n\t\t<li>(2) on the finisher barricades</li>\n\t\t<li>(1) on the pop-up tent by the step and repeat<br>\n\t\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><strong>YEAR-ROUND: Physical Footprint</strong><ul>\n\t\t<li>Race t-shirts worn and seen around town (see photo below or post of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=905066014989822&amp;set=gm.1018802169991841&amp;idorvanity=939360217936037\" target=\"\">t-shirt on social media</a>)</li>\n\t\t<li>(50) Yard signs displayed around Greater Richmond</li>\n\t\t<li>All (3) banners will be displayed at The Salvation Army Boys &amp; Girls Club of Richmond (3701 R Street)<ul>\n\t\t\t<li>(2) will be hung on fence enclosing the outdoor play are</li>\n\t\t\t<li>(1) will be hung under the score board in the gym<br>\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><strong>YEAR-ROUND: Digital Footprint (<span style=\"color:#22b573;\"><em>sponsor company name&nbsp;tagged, as available, in all social media posts</em></span>)</strong><ul>\n\t\t<li>Event recap and photos on our <a href=\"https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/centralvirginia/past-events#Run-for-Hope-Sept-14-2024\" target=\"\">Past Events webpage</a></li>\n\t\t<li>Social media posts and reels on Facebook</li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.909422491220841&amp;type=3\" target=\"\">Facebook Event Album</a>&nbsp;and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/reel/8118624761518098\" target=\"\">Pre-Event Reel</a> (already 2.5K plays between all platforms)</li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/salarmyrva_rva-rva-peoplepowered-activity-7242167740059332608-bTz8?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop\" target=\"\">LinkedIn Event Album</a></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>",
